  "vsUSSFoundations": "The prior 'USS' foundations file had ~68 semantic tokens (light/dark as true variable modes) + a smaller base palette (~92 swatches) in a single 'Figma-Color' style collection. USS One keeps a compatible 'Figma-Color' sync collection (144 vars) but promotes a much larger 'Color' collection (343 vars) as canonical, adding: a second Secondary/Facultad blue-gray ramp, the Facultad accent theming system (on-light/on-dark A/B/C), and Tono-Exito/Alerta/Error feedback accent variants."
